但我真正想聊的是瑞安的服装。

534
00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:31.160
Oh, honey.
哦，亲爱的。

535
00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:32.920
As the horror movie director.
作为恐怖电影导演的造型。

536
00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:36.260
Oh, I had a whole thing that says right here,
哦，我这儿专门写了一段，

537
00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.500
we have got to break down Ryan's outfit.
