00:26:34.400 --> 00:26:36.580
This is the big reveal at the end of the episode.
这是这一集结尾的大揭秘。

635
00:26:36.760 --> 00:26:37.560
Kevin's a poet.
凯文是个诗人。

636
00:26:37.820 --> 00:26:39.380
Ryan plays the saxophone.
瑞安会吹萨克斯风。

637
00:26:39.500 --> 00:26:40.520
We're learning so much.
我们学到了好多东西。

638
00:26:40.580 --> 00:26:40.940
So much.
好多。

639
00:26:41.360 --> 00:26:43.040
Up next is episode three.
接下来是第三集。

